!public/clips/README.md
# Phone recordings mirrored from the Drive drop folder (bun run footage:sync).
# Media stays out; the sidecars ARE the edit (title, cut, crop) — commit them.
public/footage/*
!public/footage/*.json
!public/footage/README.md
public/music/*
!public/music/README.md
out/
